      "content": "okay wow that sounds scary. i didn't realize it could be that serious. i'll try to rest for now but i'm also really worried about the pain keeping me awake. you mentioned ibuprofen earlier... how much should i actually take to make sure it works? like is there a certain amount i should take every few hours so it really knocks out this nerve pain so i can sleep?",
